WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.600
It's easy to think mindfulness is about your mind.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.900
Mindfulness is about putting the phone down

3
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.900
when someone small has something big to say.

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:17.900
It's tasting your mother's cooking

5
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.900
like it's the first time.

6
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.900
It's feeling the first rain

7
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.900
instead of rushing to get out of it.

8
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:34.800
It's the breath between what you feel and what you say.

9
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:39.800
None of us get these moments twice.

10
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.900
But we all deserve to actually be there for them,

11
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:49.800
while they're still happening.

12
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.600
Mindfulness isn't about your mind.

13
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
It's about your life.
